# OpenSEO configuration template — TEMPLATE ONLY, NO VALUES.
#
# The seo-ops file-import adapter never reads these variables and never reads
# the OpenSEO installation. This template exists so the operator knows which
# variables a FUTURE, separately approved credential-based API step would
# need. Do not put real values in this repository; if you ever set them, set
# them only in your local shell environment during that separate step and
# keep them out of version control.
#
# Required variables (values intentionally left blank):
OPENSEO_API_BASE_URL=
OPENSEO_API_KEY=
OPENSEO_CLIENT_ID=
OPENSEO_EXPORT_DIR=
